# Docker context là root repository; chỉ giữ manifest, config chung, source và email assets.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/
!packages/common/
!packages/common/**
!services/
!services/notification-service/
!services/notification-service/package.json
!services/notification-service/tsconfig.json
!services/notification-service/src/
!services/notification-service/src/**
!services/notification-service/assets/
!services/notification-service/assets/**

# Không đưa dependency/output/secret local vào build context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!services/notification-service/.env.example

# Metadata và file tạm không phục vụ build.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/*.log
